# Copy to .env (untracked) to isolate THIS checkout's compose project.
# docker compose auto-loads .env from this directory; the compose file maps
# COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME into the top-level project name (#437).
#
# Isolated projects get their own images, containers, volumes and network,
# so a lane run here can never reuse another worktree's stale images. The
# pinned 172.28.0.0/16 lab network still allows only one lab at a time per
# host — tear the other down first (docker compose down -v).
#
# Suffix by branch, purpose or hostname — anything unique per checkout:
# COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME=cloud-lab-mybranch
